# One-shot week-1 review of the situational-awareness alerts: summarizes what
# fired and pipes a tier-2 go/no-go judgment through a LOCAL model (Hermes via
# Ollama → Claude → manual), then writes the note to the vault + notifies.
# Sovereign by design — the judgment runs on-box, not in a cloud session.
# Scheduled by: claw situation schedule-review <YYYY-MM-DD> [HH:MM]
[Unit]
Description=OPEN CLAW situation week-1 review (local-model tier-2 go/no-go)
After=default.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/usr/bin/env bash %h/.dotfiles/scripts/utils/situation.sh review
